# direnv integration: `direnv allow` once, then the toolchain is on PATH
# whenever you cd into the repo — no `nix develop` needed.
#
# This loads the *bash* environment (direnv is non-interactive), so it gives
# you the tools without switching your shell. Run `nix develop` when you want
# the oh-my-zsh shell itself.
#
# Install nix-direnv for a cached, fast reload:
#   https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv
use flake
watch_file flake.nix
watch_file nix/zsh.nix
watch_file nix/neovim.nix
